🚩 AI Job Red Flag Detector
Overview

This project demonstrates how AI can help job seekers evaluate opportunities before applying. Using Claude, job descriptions are analyzed to identify potential red flags, company risks, remote-work concerns, and important interview questions.

Objective
Detect hidden red flags in job postings
Evaluate company-related risks
Validate remote-work claims
Generate smart interview questions
Prompt Used
Analyze this job description and provide:

1. Potential red flags
2. Company-related risks
3. Hidden expectations
4. Remote-work validation
5. Suggested interview questions

[Paste Job Description Here]
Example Findings
Red Flags
Weekend work expectations
No salary transparency
Vague responsibilities
Remote Work Concerns
Advertised as remote but requires office visits
Possible hybrid role
Interview Questions
What does success look like in the first 90 days?
How often are office visits required?
How is work-life balance maintained?
Key Learnings
AI can quickly identify risks in job descriptions.
Job applications are a two-way evaluation process.
Better interview questions lead to better career decisions.
Tools Used
Claude AI
Prompt Engineering
Conclusion

This project showcases how AI can act as a career intelligence assistant, helping candidates make smarter and more informed job application decisions.

